{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Test 8","y":0.060954063879707698,"w":0.059670778910319022,"x":0.86213991854381167},{"w":0.745031992594401,"c":1,"h":0.017049319892946224,"t":"KATIE: So I thought I'd start with Giannetti, who's a professor of film and literature, and in one.","x":0.082225420966896653,"y":0.10431694130237978},{"t":". Q21","x":0.82304526805107581,"w":0.051440327962239518,"y":0.10895170804029886,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"x":0.13777821526092718,"w":0.68536259969075519,"h":0.017265758469472647,"c":1,"t":"of his books he came up with a straightforward classification of film adaptations based","y":0.11980579288876936},{"t":"on how faithful they are to the original plays and novels.","c":1,"h":0.018288788722457205,"x":0.13770146831508465,"y":0.13441379118321328,"w":0.44687962849934892},{"x":0.082304526946531689,"y":0.15261627891474661,"w":0.032921810150146488,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574,"t":"JOE:"},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.1316872437430078,"y":0.15116279052430948,"w":0.055555553436279298,"t":"Right."},{"h":0.014534883982160851,"x":0.080246925927152019,"y":0.1671511626547777,"c":1,"w":0.69547322591145833,"t":"KATIE: I've already made some notes on that, so I just need to sort those out before the"},{"t":"presentation. I thought that next I'd ask the class to come up with the worst examples","c":1,"h":0.016154006176197111,"w":0.68120717366536465,"x":0.13574839824925258,"y":0.18217064524310422},{"x":0.135699510225258,"c":1,"t":"of Shakespeare adaptations that they've seen, and to say why. That should be more","y":0.19705156197134344,"w":0.67098561604817708,"h":0.017508164171054941},{"x":0.1355687111253106,"t":"fun than having their favourite versions.","w":0.31939389546712238,"y":0.21212090234156222,"h":0.017831335078981936,"c":1},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.082304526913952833,"w":0.032921810150146488,"c":1,"y":0.23110465105535183,"t":"JOE:"},{"w":0.29629628499348959,"t":"Yes, I can certainly think of a couple!","y":0.22819767425770832,"x":0.13580247416992194,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.24354185402725703,"t":"KATIE: Right. Next I want to talk about Rachel Malchow. I came across something on the","x":0.080180110418369657,"w":0.70178217569986978,"h":0.016802915274324648},{"w":0.67078191121419262,"h":0.016032884483202725,"x":0.13374484668172176,"c":1,"t":"internet about her work on film adaptations, and I was thinking of showing some film","y":0.26017441845667633},{"x":0.13545257932128038,"c":1,"t":"clips to illustrate her ideas.","y":0.27208862187728888,"w":0.21686968485514321,"h":0.01876697214528722},{"y":0.29215116264744578,"x":0.078189300799215197,"w":0.034979422887166337,"t":"JOE:","c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"h":0.018895047011448396,"t":"Will you have enough time, though? Both to prepare and during the presentation?","x":0.12745388766222221,"c":1,"y":0.2891596408076007,"w":0.65866068522135413},{"t":"After all, I doubt if you'll be able to find all the clips you want.","y":0.30458043813621305,"x":0.13362859692824922,"w":0.4837732950846354,"h":0.017106275255183045,"c":1},{"h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1,"x":0.078189308989638745,"w":0.72016459147135425,"y":0.321220930083291,"t":"KATIE: Hmm. Perhaps you're right. OK, well, I'd better do some slides instead, saying how"},{"x":0.83333333393687814,"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.3241279068228532,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q23","c":1},{"h":0.018093601694095796,"t":"various films relate to what she says. That should encourage discussion.","c":1,"w":0.58052378336588539,"x":0.13362427334639185,"y":0.33516819413307042},{"t":"KATIE: Next I want to say something about how plays may be chosen for adaptation because","y":0.365945307829322,"c":1,"w":0.74304209391276044,"h":0.018030955176471464,"x":0.076024128709809041},{"t":"they're concerned with issues of the time when the film is made.","y":0.38006107117557764,"h":0.019755661136550806,"x":0.13150982436849404,"w":0.51482025146484378,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.13361076443197051,"w":0.48171579996744796,"t":"You mean things like patriotism, or the role of governments?","y":0.39695612758047183,"h":0.01716951206238726},{"c":1,"y":0.41215848386483023,"w":0.57844477335611977,"t":"KATIE: Exactly. It's quite tricky, but l've got a few ideas I'd like to discuss.","x":0.076017964982732639,"h":0.018564841491735207},{"t":"KATIE: And finally I want to talk about a few adaptations that I think illustrate a range of","y":0.4513488939800202,"w":0.69148874918619785,"x":0.076067874140219233,"h":0.016808034112793302,"c":1},{"t":"approaches, and make some comments on them. Do you know the Japanese film","c":1,"y":0.46747086940197147,"h":0.015797499352265265,"w":0.6503362019856771,"x":0.1336791390554915},{"h":0.013081395583944833,"x":0.13168724289170253,"y":0.48255813938618375,"c":1,"w":0.047325102488199849,"t":"Ran?"},{"t":"JOE:","c":1,"x":0.076131687640778975,"w":0.03497942288716635,"y":0.49999999987802624,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"h":0.021468176016116725,"c":1,"t":"I haven't seen it. It was based on Shakespeare's King Lear, wasn't it?","x":0.12736746890458089,"y":0.49527246750818898,"w":0.55801569620768232},{"x":0.073980556806513109,"t":"KATIE: That's right. It was a very loose adaptation, using the same situation and story, but","y":0.51262109180835924,"w":0.71627899169921871,"h":0.018161191255099962,"c":1},{"t":"moving it to 16th century Japan instead of 16th century Britain. So for example the","x":0.12954118169655696,"w":0.65656992594401042,"h":0.018164439251903142,"c":1,"y":0.52777525519190871},{"x":0.12940095298752,"t":"king's daughters become sons, because in Japanese culture at that time, women","y":0.54211874698555573,"c":1,"h":0.022407860862633022,"w":0.64651601155598959},{"y":0.55983547548127865,"t":"couldn't succeed to the throne.","h":0.012902688923937977,"c":1,"x":0.13157912319521722,"w":0.24716211954752607},{"y":0.57703488357862742,"x":0.074074074287066666,"t":"JOE:","w":0.032921810150146488,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512463},{"w":0.67918233235677083,"y":0.57503879906253674,"t":"OK. I hope you're going to talk about the1993 film of Much Ado About Nothing. I think","x":0.12954107430671843,"c":1,"h":0.018204033023757837},{"w":0.65257802327473957,"h":0.020348033298452028,"c":1,"y":0.58874704019063828,"t":"that's one of the best Shakespeare films. It really brings the play to life, doesn't it?","x":0.127413553009146},{"c":1,"h":0.01846521341618157,"x":0.071906828152818889,"y":0.60561225634703797,"t":"KATIE: Yes, I agree. And I think filming it in Italy. where the play is set, makes you see what","w":0.72654266357421871},{"x":0.12946736275176116,"w":0.27603947957356767,"t":"life was like at the time of the play.","h":0.016051894503572139,"y":0.62081813116195395,"c":1},{"x":0.069958848346222069,"y":0.63953488359957467,"w":0.037037035624186199,"c":1,"t":"JOE:","h":0.010174418787512574},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"t":"KATIE:","x":0.072016460777947128,"y":0.65406976730968269,"w":0.045267489751180015},{"x":0.12962962999683469,"y":0.63808139522578711,"c":1,"t":"Absolutely. Right, what's next?","w":0.24691357930501301,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.65255930582682287,"y":0.65093327637260967,"t":"Er, next, I thought Romeo & Juliet, the 1996 film, which moves the action into the","c":1,"x":0.12539172962833922,"h":0.019193799813026824},{"h":0.015164954923488128,"w":0.10339830398559569,"t":"present day.","x":0.12735409618407953,"y":0.66774521481077154,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166337,"t":"JOE:","x":0.072016461293042344,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.68604651152046814},{"t":"Yes, it worked really well, I thought - changing the two feuding families in the original","x":0.12750022297319843,"c":1,"y":0.68301511019446104,"w":0.67913314819335946,"h":0.018029138252788512},{"y":0.69905771516457449,"c":1,"t":"to two competing business empires, even though they're speaking in the English of the","w":0.69341562906901044,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.12551440755860388},{"t":"original play.","x":0.12731501838214065,"y":0.71428000447608564,"w":0.10339264551798505,"h":0.014799321357718109,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.069958848730794138,"w":0.055555553436279298,"t":"KATIE:","y":0.73110465098577604,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"x":0.12130632148174944,"h":0.018653020982326685,"t":"You'd expect it would sound really bizarre, but I found I soon got used to it.","y":0.72926870049119563,"w":0.60100596110026039},{"t":"JOE:","h":0.0087209298276508251,"x":0.072016460974309471,"c":1,"w":0.032921810150146488,"y":0.74709302334925598},{"h":0.015598965477466087,"y":0.74495692494866572,"w":0.067611344655354802,"x":0.12469590618070724,"c":1,"t":"Me too."},{"x":0.072016460561278403,"c":1,"t":"KATIE:","y":0.76308139524624319,"w":0.043209877014160153,"h":0.0087209303892965551},{"w":0.65432098388671878,"c":1,"x":0.12345679550520022,"y":0.76017441879153536,"h":0.017505204298471022,"t":"Then I thought I'd include a real Hollywood film, one that's intended to appeal to a"},{"x":0.12733925357313525,"t":"mass commercial audience.","y":0.77400148474587771,"c":1,"w":0.22699948628743488,"h":0.016859449963968487},{"w":0.032921810150146488,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574,"x":0.069958847908465863,"t":"JOE:","y":0.79360465103956501},{"w":0.043209877014160167,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"KATIE:","c":1,"y":0.80813953463387989,"x":0.069958847732631849},{"w":0.31952784220377606,"t":"There must be quite a number of those.","x":0.12732439755032951,"h":0.018424366612878051,"y":0.78840736099351172,"c":1},{"w":0.6442045084635416,"c":1,"y":0.80602360127304851,"h":0.017205159150248339,"x":0.12338091415737437,"t":"Yes. but l've picked the 1996 film of Hamlet. It included every line of the text. but"},{"x":0.12534034742698613,"h":0.020751425178087479,"y":0.81986103321019455,"w":0.65879740397135422,"c":1,"t":"it's more like a typical action hero movie - there are loads of special effects, but no"},{"x":0.12534925218917123,"h":0.016596101057683943,"w":0.26786265055338543,"y":0.83688334434955203,"c":1,"t":"unifying interpretation of the play."},{"x":0.067901234948245182,"y":0.85465116264467711,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166337,"t":"JOE:"},{"y":0.87063953478112699,"w":0.043209877014160153,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"t":"KATIE:","x":0.069958847392554119},{"x":0.12742963343712205,"y":0.85249272812976884,"t":"All show and no substance.","w":0.22253603617350259,"h":0.013872680169814355,"c":1},{"y":0.86732768266801374,"t":"Exactly. Then there's Prospero's Books, based on The Tempest. That was really","w":0.64006515502929684,"c":1,"h":0.017883054780454599,"x":0.12544164558973098},{"x":0.12323477196583298,"t":"innovative, from a stylistic point of view.","w":0.3194221750895182,"y":0.88254290586278195,"h":0.017284228186725259,"c":1},{"w":0.039094651540120262,"x":0.82921810622582459,"y":0.51744186030908779,"t":"Q25","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"t":"Q26","x":0.82921810790807149,"y":0.60901162818755117,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1},{"x":0.82716049305710027,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q27","y":0.65552325565792502,"w":0.039094651540120373,"c":1},{"t":"Q28","x":0.82510288126198095,"y":0.8095930230973809,"w":0.037037035624186254,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"t":"Q29","x":0.82510288125592923,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.87209302309978554,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"x":0.87037037096786318,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"113","y":0.93459302308244907},{"c":1,"h":0.017805043322739578,"x":0.39471442053964628,"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.9664181187699894,"w":0.20842512766520177}]}